a romantic relationship's marriage is an area of expertise for you. And I'm wondering how you got from studying marriage to being involved in this particular paper. Well, yeah. I mean, I have a very, very clear origin story for this. People used to ask me, you know, how did you get interested in studying, you know, romantic attraction or marriage? And I was like, well, isn't everybody interested in that? And, you know, it was nebulous.

